312
00:13:34,966 --> 00:13:40,500
a claim under $14,500 pays the firm about $415

313
00:13:40,566 --> 00:13:44,200
and the adjuster keeps 55 to 70%

314
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:48,400
that is roughly 230 to 290 dollars a claim

315
00:13:48,566 --> 00:13:51,500
four claims in a day is about a thousand dollars

316
