320
00:14:02,066 --> 00:14:06,966
in 2025 the United States had $23 billion in disasters

321
00:14:07,033 --> 00:14:09,666
yet not one Hurricane hit the mainland

322
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:13,866
a quiet year but it is not always quiet

323
