during a declared disaster

330
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:36,700
Texas can issue a 90 day emergency license for $20

331
00:14:36,700 --> 00:14:38,000
with no exam

332
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:41,333
as long as a licensed adjuster or carrier sponsors you

333
